(text "Power supervision: both rails valid before MCU release; CT open = 12-28 ms delay.\nU35 senses +5V but is powered by +3.3V, including partial back-power conditions.\nU36 is a Schmitt-input AND: HUB_RESET_N = MCU_NRST AND HUB_RESET_REQ.\nR49 holds the firmware request low during MCU reset; PA9 remains push-pull." (at 145 187 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "bf9559e2-2288-4f06-99fc-da7c49ce7546"))
